1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,160
[Samantha] Hello Daniel, today we are testing VoiceScribe.

2
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:07,120
[Samantha] Can you describe what it should do with the video recording?

3
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:08,080
[Daniel] Of course.

4
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:13,920
[Daniel] It should extract the audio, recognize the words, and show which person said each sentence.

5
00:00:13,920 --> 00:00:15,920
[Daniel] Everything should work on this Mac.

6
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:16,560
[Samantha] Great.

7
00:00:16,560 --> 00:00:19,920
[Samantha] We also need to rename speakers and export subtitles.

8
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:23,200
[Samantha] I will check the transcript before sharing it with our team.

9
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:24,640
[Daniel] That sounds useful.

10
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:30,080
[Daniel] Even when there is only one audio channel, the two voices should receive different speaker labels.
